            <div xml:id="d7">

                <pb facs="0012" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg6"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">859A.20/173: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iceland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacVeagh</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-02T15:00:00-04:00">May 2, 1942—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>126. Matter referred to in your 217, April 21, has been laid before the
                    President. Pending his decision, no action should be taken by you on General
                    Bonesteel’s request.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
